	<Description>
		At a Mexican restaurant that we love, we built up a relationship with one of the waitresses named Consuelo.
		At one point she came over to our house and made us a Mexican meal from scratch.
		<br />
		It was so AWESOME, that Ransom and Di had her come back over and make it again so he could write down what she did and create this recipe.
		<br /><br />
		<div class="RECIPE_INSTRUCTION_NOTE" style="margin-left:2em;">
			<b>NOTE</b>:
			<br />
			"Mexican Beans of Comfort" translated to Spanish is "Frijoles Mexicano de Consuelo"
			<br />
			"Mexican Beans from Consuelo" translated to Spanish is "Frijoles Mexicano de Consuelo"
			<br />
			Since they are both the same, and since this recipe <b><u>is</u></b> &nbsp;from Consuelo&hellip; &smiley;
			<br />
			<span class="NOTE">(See Also <a href="./ComfortRice.xml">Mexican Rice of Comfort</a>)</span>
		</div>
		<br />
	</Description>

